ntent":"[15:36:32] Review the prototype script at /root/personalization/bin/context_budget.sh and the tool-call layer (especially iar-tool-call.el and iar-request-watchdog.el) to plan how to integrate the context budget rule into the Emacs configuration.\n\nThe integration should:\n- Track tool calls per cycle (similar to the prototype script)\n- Exit with a specific code (e.g., 1) when the threshold (200 tool calls ~ 400 msgs) is exceeded\n- Be implemented in the tool-call layer or cycle guard (iar-agent-cycle.el) without breaking existing functionality.\n\nThis integration is to be done in an interactive session with Nacho, as it requires modifying .el files.\n[t+01:26/60:00 c10/300]"}]
